<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Roulette</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="../assets/roulette-icon.png">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sarpanch:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Monda:wght@400..700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/styles/login.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/styles/search.css" /> 
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/styles/home.css" /> 
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/styles/login.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/styles/profile.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/styles/info.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/styles/loading.css">

</head>
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-PC4C8EF3QM"></script>
<script>
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
  gtag('js', new Date());

  gtag('config', 'G-PC4C8EF3QM');
</script>
<body>
    <div class="home-header d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
        <div class="nav-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center px-5 mt-2">
            <h1> <img class="nav-img" src='../assets/logo-single-note-white.png'> <span id="navName">music roulette</span></h1>
            <div id="login" class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center"><a href="/" class="default-button">Login with Spotify</a></div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="break"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2">
            <h1 id="headerText">Discover New Music on Spotify via Your Friend's Playlists</h1>
        </div>

        <div id="player">

            
            <div class=" screen-container col d-flex justify-content-center">
                <!-- Screen Container -->
                
                <div id="screen">

                    <div class=" topBar d-flex p-1 align-items-center justify-content-between">
                        <div id="time">12:05</div>
                        <button id="info"></button>
                        <button id="profile"></button>
                        <a id="search" href="/me"></a>
                        <div id="battery"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="divider"></div>
                    <!-- song player  loading=flex, song=block, info=block, profile=block -->
                    <div class="loadingContainer justify-content-center align-items-center" style="display: flex" id="loadingBlockSearch"><%- include("partials/loadingAreaSearch.ejs") %></div>
                    <div class="searchContainerAfter justify-content-center align-items-center" style="display: none;" id="searchBlock"><%- include("partials/userSearchedAreaHome.ejs") %></div>
                    <div class="loadingContainer justify-content-center align-items-center" style="display: none" id="loadingBlock"><%- include("partials/loadingArea.ejs") %></div>
                    <div class="songContainer justify-content-center align-items-center" style="display: none" id="songBlock"><%- include("partials/songAreaHome.ejs") %></div>

                </div>
                
            </div>

        <!---TO: DO -> Add border/ shadow inset/ or shadow on random and mute buttons to give 3d effect, reference button wheel-->
        <div class="buttonContainer d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-md-5 gap-3">
                <div id="circle">
                    <button id="q1" class="quarter"> <div id="raise-volume"></div> </button>
                    <button id="q2" class="quarter"> <div id="skip"></div> </button>
                    <button id="q3" class="quarter"> <div id="previous"></div> </button>
                    <button id="q4" class="quarter"> <div id="lower-volume"></div> </button>
                    <button class="center-button" id="play"></button>
                </div>                

                

            <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center">
                <button id="randomize" data-user="<%= locals.userId %>""></button>
                <button id="mute"></button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <p id="footerNote">roulette | ryan burnett</p>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center flex-column">
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
            <h2 style="text-align: center;">Take a Spin on Music Roulette...</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
            <div class="scroller">
                <marquee behavior="" direction="">
                    <div class="scroller-inner">
                    <img class="homeAlbum" src='../assets/darling.jpg'/>
                    <img class="homeAlbum" src='../assets/stranger-in-the-alps.png' />
                    <img class="homeAlbum" src='../assets/guard-dog.jpeg' />
                    <img class="homeAlbum" src='../assets/the-fray.jpg' />
                    <img class="homeAlbum" src='../assets/the-fray-2.jpg' />
                    <img class="homeAlbum" src='../assets/grouper.jpg' />
                    <img class="homeAlbum" src='../assets/lush.jpg' />
                    <img class="homeAlbum" src='../assets/sonder-son.jpeg' />
                    <img class="homeAlbum" src='../assets/babel.jpg' />
                    <img class="homeAlbum" src='../assets/paper-kites.jpg' />
                </div>
                </marquee>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center homeText">
        </div>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
                <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3 mt-2" style="color: black; text-align: center; width: 80%;" class="px-5 my-4">
                    <h3>Music Roulette can take any Spotify user and create a queue of 10 songs randomly selected from that user's public playlists.</h3>
                </div>
            </div>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center mt-3">
                <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 40px;">Discover Music in an Organic Way</h2>
        </div>
        <div style="background-color: white;" class="blackExplainer">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center mt-5 gap-3 flex-column flex-lg-row">
                    <div class="screen-home d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
                        <img id="homeGif" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex flex-column">
                        <h3 class="gifText">FRIENDS.</h3>
                        <h3 class="gifText">MUSIC.</h3>
                        <h3 class="gifText">ROULETTE.</h3>
                    </div>
                    
            </div>               
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
                <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3 mt-2" style="color: black; text-align: center; width: 80%;" class="px-5 my-4">
                    <h3>Instead of relying on Spotify's recomendation alogrithm and methods, you can search for your friends profiles and Music Roulette will assemble a queue of 10 random songs from their public playlists.</h3>
                    <h3>Users can save songs and redirect to their selected user's playlist or profile. Take back control of your music listening experience and find new songs in a wholesome and organic way!</h3>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
     
    

    
</body>
<script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/3.7.1/jquery.min.js"></script>
<script src="/scripts/playerJS.js"></script>
<script src="https://unpkg.com/color.js@1.2.0/dist/color.js"></script>
<script src="/scripts/home.js"></script>

</html>